sequenceDiagram
  actor A as Admin
  actor R as Resident
  participant W as Web portal
  participant API as Habitus API (PollsController)
  participant SVC as PollService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  Note over A,DB: REQ-POLL-001 — creation (Admin only)
  A->>W: Fill poll form (announcement link, title, description, options, expiry)
  W->>API: POST /api/condominiums/{condoId}/polls
  API->>API: JWT + CondominiumId claim == {condoId} (403 otherwise)
  API->>SVC: CreateAsync(condoId, userId, request)
  SVC->>SVC: Validate: role Admin, announcement belongs to condo, description, ≥2 options, ExpiresAtUtc in future
  SVC->>DB: INSERT Poll + PollOptions (one transaction)
  DB-->>SVC: Poll saved
  SVC-->>API: PollDto
  API-->>W: 201 Created

  Note over R,DB: REQ-POLL-002/004 — single vote with atomic double-vote prevention
  R->>W: Open poll, choose option
  W->>API: POST /api/condominiums/{condoId}/polls/{pollId}/votes {pollOptionId}
  API->>API: CondominiumId claim check (cross-condo → 403/404)
  API->>SVC: CastVoteAsync(condoId, pollId, userId, request)
  SVC->>DB: Load poll WHERE CondominiumId = condoId
  alt Poll expired or Closed
    SVC-->>API: InvalidOperationException (read-only) — REQ-POLL-003
    API-->>W: 400 poll_closed_or_expired
  else Active and not voted
    SVC->>DB: INSERT PollVote — unique index (PollId, VotedByUserId)
    alt Unique violation (concurrent double vote)
      DB-->>SVC: DbUpdateException
      SVC-->>API: InvalidOperationException already_voted
      API-->>W: 409 Conflict
    else Vote accepted
      DB-->>SVC: Vote saved
      SVC->>DB: Aggregate per-option counts
      SVC-->>API: PollDto with results + myVote
      API-->>W: 200 OK
    end
  end

  Note over R,DB: REQ-POLL-003 — results after voting and after expiry
  R->>W: View poll
  W->>API: GET /api/condominiums/{condoId}/polls/{pollId}
  API->>SVC: GetByIdAsync(condoId, pollId, userId)
  SVC->>DB: Poll + options + counts (+ user's vote if any)
  SVC-->>API: PollDto (IsExpired derived from ExpiresAtUtc)
  API-->>W: 200 OK (voting disabled when expired)
